            Node("raw-cut-21631", "raw_cut_21631", "Original suffix at depth 12, code 75127, node 553187",
                "The statement is EJMOriginalReplayAssembly.Accepted at depth 12, code 75127 and original node 553187. Its checker retains remaining fuel 9, the full prefixCache and full prefixPartial. The proof transports the concrete memoized checker equation through check_eq_original at exactly this fuel, index, cache and partial assignment. Decoder memoization supplies equality; the concrete suffix check remains a separate premise of the transport.", DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Node("response-cut-21504", "response_cut_21504", "Canonical response for cut 21504",
